{"step_index":1842,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-29T02:42:46Z","thinking":"**Analyzing Performance Breakthroughs**\n\nI'm incredibly excited! The speedup numbers are staggering. With 250 million nodes, average consensus time plummeted from 57ms to a mere 25.93ms! Peak throughput also hit a phenomenal 9.64 billion nodes per second. Even at 1 billion nodes, we saw a remarkable improvement, with consensus dropping from 288ms to 176.1ms. These results are incredibly promising and represent a huge breakthrough!\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Fix SIMD vector boundary check in NEON phase worker to ensure 100% pure consensus across all 16 SIMD lanes\"","EndLine":"120","Instruction":"\"Fix SIMD vector boundary masking to ensure exact per-lane Byzantine status determination\"","ReplacementContent":"\"        for (; i < vector_end; i += 64) {\\n            __builtin_prefetch(&states[i + 256], 1, 3);\\n\\n            for (int k = 0; k < 64; k += 16) {\\n                uint64_t idx = i + k;\\n                uint8_t byz_mask_bytes[16];\\n                for (int b = 0; b < 16; b++) {\\n                    byz_mask_bytes[b] = ((idx + b) < byz_cutoff) ? 1 : 0;\\n                }\\n                uint8x16_t is_byz = vld1q_u8(byz_mask_bytes);\\n                uint8x16_t vote = vbslq_u8(vceqq_u8(is_byz, vdupq_n_u8(1)), alt_vec, prop_vec);\\n                uint8x16_t curr = vld1q_u8(&states[idx]);\\n\\n                uint8x16_t updated = vorrq_u8(vandq_u8(curr, mask_clear), vorrq_u8(vandq_u8(vote, vdupq_n_u8(0x03)), vshlq_n_u8(is_byz, 6)));\\n                vst1q_u8(&states[idx], updated);\\n            }\\n        }\"","StartLine":"55","TargetContent":"\"        for (; i < vector_end; i += 64) {\\n            __builtin_prefetch(&states[i + 256], 1, 3);\\n\\n            for (int k = 0; k < 64; k += 16) {\\n                uint64_t idx = i + k;\\n                uint8x16_t curr = vld1q_u8(&states[idx]);\\n                uint8x16_t is_byz = (idx < byz_cutoff) ? vdupq_n_u8(1) : vdupq_n_u8(0);\\n                uint8x16_t vote = vbslq_u8(is_byz, alt_vec, prop_vec);\\n\\n                uint8x16_t updated = vorrq_u8(vandq_u8(curr, mask_clear), vorrq_u8(vandq_u8(vote, vdupq_n_u8(0x03)), vshlq_n_u8(is_byz, 6)));\\n                vst1q_u8(&states[idx], updated);\\n            }\\n        }\"","TargetFile":"\"/Volumes/Untitled/SSOT_Agentic_Brain_v1.1.0_ENGINEERING_RELEASE/ops/runtime/neon_simd_10x_bft_engine.c\"","toolAction":"\"Fixing SIMD lane boundary mask\"","toolSummary":"\"Fix SIMD lane boundary mask\""}}]}
